# AU-Tum TAM Parameter List - Version 2 (TAM framework only, zero-GPP prevention)
# Based on analysis of 1000-member ensemble (analyze_zero_gpp.py)
#
# Format: parameter_name distribution_type min max
# ==================================================================================

# ROOT C:N RATIOS - CRITICAL for avoiding zero GPP
# Low C:N (high N) + long roots = N sequestration in roots → zero leaf photosynthesis
froottcn 5 100 160   # Transport root C:N (min raised: 20→100 to avoid zero GPP)
frootacn 5 70 110    # Absorptive root C:N (min raised: 11→70 to avoid zero GPP)
frootmcn 5 13 22     # Mycorrhizal root C:N (narrowed to safe range)

# ROOT C:P RATIOS - Representative only
froottcp 5 450 900   # Transport root C:P only (removed absorptive/mycorrhizal - correlated)

# ROOT LONGEVITY - CRITICAL for avoiding zero GPP
# Long absorptive roots with high N = disaster
froott_long 5 4 8    # Transport root longevity (years)
froota_long 5 0.6 1.2 # Absorptive root longevity (years) (max reduced: 4→1.2)
frootm_long 5 0.3 0.7 # Mycorrhizal root longevity (years)

# ROOT CHEMISTRY - Most influential
frt_flab 5 0.15 0.30  # Transport root labile fraction
fra_flab 5 0.15 0.30  # Absorptive root labile fraction

# ROOT-LEAF ALLOCATION - Controls leaf carbon
froott_leaf 5 0.10 0.30  # Transport root to leaf allocation
froota_leaf 5 0.25 0.50  # Absorptive root to leaf allocation

# ==================================================================================
# PARAMETER COUNT: 11 (pure TAM framework)
#
# WARNING: This TAM-only version may produce GPP below observed range
# For robust calibration reaching observed GPP (2500-4500 gC/m²/year), use:
#   AU-Tum_parm_list_tam_v2_robust (adds leafcn, slatop)
#
# ZERO GPP PREVENTION:
#   - Original: 342/1000 (34.2%) zero GPP
#   - With these ranges: Expected <5% zero GPP
#   - Key fixes: Higher C:N minimums, lower absorptive longevity maximum
#
# ENSEMBLE SIZE: 1000 samples minimum for robust surrogates
# ==================================================================================
